      "day": 8,
      "line": "📓 Codex: a cart-driver with flour on their sleeves arrived (trader)."
    },
    {
      "day": 9,
      "line": "Olivia leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Lockpick. Buy it off. It steals FIRST and fights second — but it CANNOT resist food. OFFER FOOD in the fight: it drops your things mid-scamper for the meal. A bribe is cheaper than a chase.\""
    },
